    ],
    "text": "Special Direction under Section 10(1)(b)(ii)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      49.02,
      510.67,
      542.56,
      546.14
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Sub-paragraph (ii) of paragraph (b) of Subsection (1) of Section 10 of the Consumer Affairs Authority Act, No. 9 of 2003, I, Shantha Niriella, Chairman of the Consumer Affairs Authority, do hereby direct for the protection of the consumer that -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      49.02,
      553.67,
      96.79,
      567.14
    ],
    "text": "(a) any-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      73.02,
      574.67,
      435.45,
      588.14
    ],
    "text": "(i) manufacturer who engages in the manufacture, packing, storing of wholesaling ; or",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      73.02,
      595.67,
      414.82,
      609.14
    ],
    "text": "(ii) trader who engages in the retail-selling of or offers for sale or display for sale.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      49.02,
      616.67,
      542.51,
      652.14
    ],
    "text": "any type of bread specified in the Column I of Schedule hereto, shall ensure each such type of bread manufactured, packed, stored, offered for sale, displayed for sale or sold retail or wholesale, as the case may be, contain the standard weight specified in the corresponding entry in Column 2 of that Schedule ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      70.53,
      515.93,
      93.0
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2024'02'01Part I : Sec. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 01.02.20242A",
    "fonts": [
